"The keep falls, and the long front that ran from the customs road to the highlands finally has an end written on it.",
"Voss stands where Draeg's desk stood that morning and does not sit down. There is a great deal still to rebuild."
])
defeat = "The keep held, and the alliance that took eighteen days to build broke against the one wall it could not move."
